+Prepared zgui release build
+===========================
+
+Source the pinned host build environment and preserve zgui's committed Cargo.lock:
+
+source /tmp/gpui-native-env.sh
+export PATH="/nix/store/sn8r7j6q1js540y5briylnb62203zxq5-pkg-config-wrapper-0.29.2/bin:$PATH"
+export PKG_CONFIG_PATH=/tmp/gpui-zgui-todo-pc
+export CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/gpui-zgui-todo-target
+export CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=1 CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0
+export CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_OPT_LEVEL=3
+export CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_LTO=thin
+export CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_CODEGEN_UNITS=1
+export CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_DEBUG=0
+export CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_STRIP=none
+cargo --config 'build.rustflags=["-C","symbol-mangling-version=v0","--cfg","tokio_unstable"]' \
+  build --locked --release -p zgui-desktop --example todos
+
+Build evidence:
+- zgui revision: c077cd3bc2e63311e04ecc0e7b484c7e1192d595
+- Cargo.lock SHA-256: 3527083d02ea62edc3790b8603445a8431f53cc556b96ff6e53bb124dc978ee7
+- binary: /tmp/gpui-zgui-todo-target/release/examples/todos
+- binary SHA-256: e8a5de7f1c984e4dbde84b8532963b6970e1ea2aea9de2722758c499e69b7ad3
+- binary size: 28,004,320 bytes
+- build log: /tmp/gpui-zgui-todo-release-build-final.log
+- Cargo fingerprint: /tmp/gpui-zgui-todo-target/release/.fingerprint/zgui-desktop-ffe023f59e83cdc3/example-todos.json
+- Cargo fingerprint SHA-256: 3ec0973370781e3e0805e585233f0e1bff46bdb675021f77042af902b42299ab
+- DBus 1.16.2 metadata shim SHA-256: cc24775091aace1ecdf3c8732bc9a2d467bfd1b28d09bb829a326bc202f05732
+- dynamically linked DBus library SHA-256: 556eecd0f8e01fa760524b6ca8f884b5e0a7f0fcb8358a2a90261c50c3a7ce85
+
+The runtime environment has the real DBus shared library but no pkg-config
+metadata. `dbus-1.pc` supplies only the discovered version and link path; it
+does not substitute a library or enable vendored DBus.
